OL,4,
OL,5,CToday:FAny early rain soon clearing
OL,6,Fthen mainly dry with the chance of
OL,7,Fsome brightness in the north.
OL,8,FOutbreaks of rain will spread east
OL,9,Flater in the afternoon.
OL,10,
OL,11,CTonight:FIt will turn increasingly
OL,12,Fcloudy as outbreaks of rain spread
OL,13,Feast through the evening and
OL,14,Fovernight, rain becoming heavy at
OL,15,Ftimes. Mainly dry by morning with just
OL,16,Fa few showers.
OL,17,
OL,18,CTuesday:FBright spells and some
OL,19,Fshowers through the day, some turning
OL,20,Fheavy and thundery in the afternoon
OL,21,Fand early evening.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
